<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">House of Shadows</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œMs. Weaver left very specific instructions in the event of her demise. She would not want the fruits of her hard work to fall into unworthy hands. And she did not believe in handouts. It was her wish for one of you to earn your inheritance. She hand-selected the 10 of you. If you can make it through one single night in this house, you will get everything.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora's eyes shoot across the room. She notes that pretty much everyone looks like they're just taking this in. Interest and suspicion fill most of their faces in equal measure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œThis is ridiculous,â€ Glimmer says. â€œThis is some kind of prank.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œI assure you, Miss, that I don't have a sense of humor,â€ Hordak tells her.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Just one night in the creepy mansion that haunted Adoraâ€™s childhood nightmares and she can be rich. Rich enough to pay for med school, help her mom out, and secure her dreams. Thereâ€™s only 9 other people to outlast, including her two best friends, a shady cast of characters she doesnâ€™t trust, and the girl sheâ€™s been in love with her whole life. Easy.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>petty_labelle</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
